{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S03、S08、S11等短时段里话句和多组感受提示切换较密，容易来不及消化；X的固定左右栏和较少的提示更从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的【】把每段最重要的心理转折突出出来，感受又按音乐节点出现，观众不必同时处理所有文字，比较容易边听边抓重点。它也更清楚地交代了人物为什么矛盾：既不甘心再受委屈，又舍不得曾经的亲近，逐渐意识到自己真正怀念的是被接纳的感觉，最后学会带着想念继续生活。X胜在简洁和左右分栏的稳定性，但感受词较多是并列标签，音乐中的情绪变化、心理细节和前后转折不如Y具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1e11fcdb-7400-4a9a-9297-1390cd171b8a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010423219702Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:05:23.420536+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7ae2ea7d00a6c3a651aaf2cb74397f492434a1db72f7ea71e9cb2b389c97b1bc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_